{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"6731f10d20039ab8b16ecbf770fe1fc4d66828dd8febbc1ca5081852da4cb1fb","digest":{"component_or_area":"Gerrit review-bot credential and logging","key_entities":["GERRIT_BOT_TOKEN","gerrit-bot-token (SSM parameter)","review_bot/config.py","review_bot/app.py","TokenRedactingFilter","X-Rebar-Token","infra/gerrit/service-user.sh","webhooks.config","refs/meta/config","compose-review-bot-1","66af (Gerrit 1384)"],"problem_keywords":["credential rotation","token exposure","logging leak","webhook security","gerrit bot token"],"propositions":["Review-bot logs the webhook token in plaintext via query parameter (?token=) in uvicorn access logs, exposing the credential","Gerrit bot token is a shared secret used simultaneously for outbound HTTP basic-auth, inbound webhook authentication, and container environment variable, requiring atomic rotation","Code fix (66af) moves token from query string to X-Rebar-Token header and adds TokenRedactingFilter, but is not yet deployed to production container","Token rotation must be coordinated with code deployment using service-user.sh to avoid re-leaking the new token on next webhook call","Production deployment must precede rotation, followed by container restart and end-to-end verification of inbound and outbound authentication paths"]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787876651468908001,"uuid":"c027508f-aedf-4454-8204-706e6b775f24"}